---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | Emon Hossain — AI Systems Architect & Automation Builder"
  description="I build systems that save time and generate leverage. BBA NSU 2021. Founder of SYSmoAI, AI Premium Shop, and BangladeshAI. Based in Dhaka."
  ogTitle="About Emon Hossain — AI Systems Architect"
>
  <div class="container" style="padding: 4rem 1.5rem; max-width: 48rem;">
    <div class="eyebrow">ABOUT</div>
    <h1 style="font-size: 1.875rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--brand-ink); margin-top: 1rem;">Practitioner, Not Theorist</h1>
    <p style="color: var(--brand-stone-600); font-size: 1.125rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.7;">
      I build systems that save time and generate leverage. My work sits at the intersection of process automation, AI integration, and Bangladesh's digital infrastructure.
    </p>

    <div style="margin-top: 4rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3rem;">
      <!-- Story -->
      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--brand-ink); margin-bottom: 1rem;">The Story</h2>
        <div style="color: var(--brand-stone-600); font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.8; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem;">
          <p>I started building digital systems years before "AI" became a marketing word. The work was the same as it is today — replace humans clicking buttons with reliable software that runs while everyone sleeps.</p>
          <p>What changed is the toolkit. Make.com, n8n, Notion, Anthropic, and OpenAI made it possible to ship in days what used to take a six-month engineering build. The constraint stopped being "can we build this" and became "do we know what to build."</p>
          <p>Most consultants in Bangladesh sell the technology. I sell the outcome — a system that runs, hours saved, money recovered. If a client cannot point to a process that's now invisible to them, I haven't done my job.</p>
          <p>BangladeshAI grew out of the same instinct. The country was ranked, surveyed, and benchmarked by international agencies — but no one was translating those numbers into operator-level decisions for local businesses. So I started publishing the data, with the gaps mapped and the levers identified.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Philosophy -->
      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--brand-ink); margin-bottom: 1rem;">The Philosophy</h2>
        <div style="color: var(--brand-stone-600); font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.8; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem;">
          <p>Most businesses in Bangladesh run on human bandwidth. People are acting as APIs — copying data from one system, formatting it, and pasting it into another. This is fragile, unscalable, and ultimately limits the growth of the private sector.</p>
          <p>I believe in deterministic systems for reliable tasks (invoicing, reporting, data movement) and probabilistic models (LLMs) for cognitive tasks (summarization, sentiment analysis, drafting).</p>
          <p>Bangladesh doesn't need more conference panels about AI. It needs operators who can wire up Make.com, write custom Python scripts, securely connect local APIs like bKash, and hand over a functioning system that saves 15 hours a week.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Stack -->
      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--brand-ink); margin-bottom: 1rem;">The Stack</h2>
        <div style="display: grid; gap: 1rem; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);">
          <div style="background: white; border: 1px solid var(--brand-stone-200); border-radius: 0.75rem; padding: 1rem;">
            <div style="color: var(--brand-stone-400); font-size: 0.625rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;">Automation</div>
            <div style="color: var(--brand-ink); font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 0.25rem;">Make.com, n8n, Zapier</div>
          </div>
          <div style="background: white; border: 1px solid var(--brand-stone-200); border-radius: 0.75rem; padding: 1rem;">
            <div style="color: var(--brand-stone-400); font-size: 0.625rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;">Architecture</div>
            <div style="color: var(--brand-ink); font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 0.25rem;">Notion, Airtable, Xano</div>
          </div>
          <div style="background: white; border: 1px solid var(--brand-stone-200); border-radius: 0.75rem; padding: 1rem;">
            <div style="color: var(--brand-stone-400); font-size: 0.625rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;">Development</div>
            <div style="color: var(--brand-ink); font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 0.25rem;">Python, React, Node.js</div>
          </div>
          <div style="background: white; border: 1px solid var(--brand-stone-200); border-radius: 0.75rem; padding: 1rem;">
            <div style="color: var(--brand-stone-400); font-size: 0.625rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;">AI Models</div>
            <div style="color: var(--brand-ink); font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 0.25rem;">OpenAI, Anthropic, Claude</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Timeline -->
      <section>
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--brand-ink); margin-bottom: 1rem;">Timeline</h2>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem;">
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem;">
            <div style="width: 0.125rem; background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--brand-indigo), var(--brand-sky), var(--brand-emerald)); flex-shrink: 0;"></div>
            <div>
              <div style="color: var(--brand-stone-400); font-size: 0.625rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;">2024 — Present</div>
              <h3 style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--brand-ink); margin-top: 0.25rem;">Founder, AI Premium Shop</h3>
              <p style="color: var(--brand-stone-600); font-size: 0.875rem; margin-top: 0.25rem;">Building Bangladesh's AI subscription marketplace. Thousands of customers served.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem;">
            <div style="width: 0.125rem; background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--brand-indigo), var(--brand-sky), var(--brand-emerald)); flex-shrink: 0;"></div>
            <div>
              <div style="color: var(--brand-stone-400); font-size: 0.625rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;">2024 — Present</div>
              <h3 style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--brand-ink); margin-top: 0.25rem;">Founder, BangladeshAI</h3>
              <p style="color: var(--brand-stone-600); font-size: 0.875rem; margin-top: 0.25rem;">Publishing the definitive research on national AI readiness. Mapping 67 critical gaps across 15 domains.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem;">
            <div style="width: 0.125rem; background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--brand-indigo), var(--brand-sky), var(--brand-emerald)); flex-shrink: 0;"></div>
            <div>
              <div style="color: var(--brand-stone-400); font-size: 0.625rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;">2023 — Present</div>
              <h3 style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--brand-ink); margin-top: 0.25rem;">Founder, SYSmoAI</h3>
              <p style="color: var(--brand-stone-600); font-size: 0.875rem; margin-top: 0.25rem;">Building no-code and AI systems for Bangladeshi SMBs and agencies.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>